oading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Samora Machel</span><span class="tp">1933–1986</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/wim-kok"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/wim-kok.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Wim Kok</span><span class="tp">1938–2018</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 29 September <span class="n">8</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/charles-of-blois"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Charles of Blois</span><span class="tp">1319–1364</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/gustav-i-of-sweden"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/gustav-i-of-sweden.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Gustav I of Sweden</span><span class="tp">1496–1560</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ferdinand-vii-of-spain"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ferdinand-vii-of-spain.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ferdinand VII of Spain</span><span class="tp">1784–1833</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/machado-de-assis"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/machado-de-assis.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Machado de Assis</span><span class="tp">1839–1908</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/rudolf-diesel"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/rudolf-diesel.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Rudolf Diesel</span><span class="tp">1858–1913</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/anastasio-somoza-garcia"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/anastasio-somoza-garcia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Anastasio Somoza García</span><span class="tp">1896–1956</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/nguyen-van-thieu"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/nguyen-van-thieu.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Nguyen Van Thieu</span><span class="tp">1923–2001</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/s-n-goenka"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">S. N. Goenka</span><span class="tp">1924–2013</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
